@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor Browser
component "React/Vite (dev)\nCaddy (production)" as Web
component "Spring Boot API" as API
component "Workspace baseline\ntrusted session + tenant resource bindings" as Baseline
component "Verification / activation / payment mail\n(leased PostgreSQL jobs)" as MailWorker
component "Shared branded HTML + text template" as MailTemplate
component "Payment create / reconcile / apply\n(leased PostgreSQL jobs)" as PaymentWorker
cloud "payOS merchant API" as PayOS
cloud "SMTP\nGmail / isolated Mailpit" as SMTP
component "Spring Boot migrate profile" as Migrate
database "PostgreSQL" as PG
database "Neo4j" as Graph

Browser --> Web
Web --> API : /api
API --> PG
API --> MailWorker : scheduled transactional delivery
MailWorker --> MailTemplate : escaped content + authorized recipient
API --> PaymentWorker : durable order / verified observation
PaymentWorker --> PG : snapshots, application, period, workspace
PaymentWorker --> PG : atomic payment-confirmed outbox event
PaymentWorker --> PayOS : signed create / trusted status
PayOS --> API : signed webhook (not browser redirects)
API --> PG : membership + request-time entitlement
API --> Baseline : L&D configuration / own Employee attempts
Baseline --> PG : pinned questions / transactions / results
Baseline --> Graph : authorized reviewed catalog
MailWorker --> PG : outbox, lease, delivery state
MailWorker --> SMTP : bounded SMTP retries
API --> Graph
Migrate --> PG : Flyway V1-V32
note bottom of Graph : Migration does not reseed or overwrite graph data.
@enduml
